WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:03.629
Summer 1975.

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:07.216
Rumor came around that
the inspired Dylan was back...

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:10.135
gathering all his forces.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.554
I wanna tell you something.

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:18.644
The idea was to put a tour up.

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:21.563
You should be playing
20,000-seaters.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.358
But instead,&nbsp;
he wanted only small venues.

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:26.193
We're really running
short of time.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.778
I wanna introduce Bob Dylan!

00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:30.906
Boy, I sure hope
we get to Boston on time.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:35.410
The tour was a catastrophe.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.746
It wasn't a success...

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:41.124
not if you measure success
in terms of profit.

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:45.128
The nation was so divided.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:48.465
So they embarked
on a journey through America.

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:58.559
Bob Dylan, Joan Baez,&nbsp;
and Jack Elliott,

00:00:58.642 --> 00:01:00.102
right in the Civic Center.

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:02.145
You know me.&nbsp;I'm too old
for that kind of thing.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:03.146
Oh, well...

00:01:05.566 --> 00:01:08.735
The charisma that he has,
I've never seen anywhere

00:01:08.819 --> 00:01:09.903
before or since.

00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:12.322
It was a circus atmosphere.

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:15.033
It was a feeling of being alive.

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:16.994
We didn't have enough masks
on that tour.

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:21.790
They said, "How about if you
come on the road with us?"

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.168
He hasn't done an interview
in 20 years.

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:28.422
Joan Baez and me could&nbsp;
sing together in our sleep.

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:58.702
Bob's always been searching
for something else.

00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:02.247
-I think he liked the chaos.
-Focus in on that.

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:07.169
Life isn't
about finding yourself...

00:02:07.252 --> 00:02:08.295
or finding anything.

00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:12.758
Life is
about creating yourself.

